<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="line">
      <text>当前学年</text>
      <text class="value">{{year}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="line">
      <text>下一学年</text>
      <input class="input" value="{{nextYear}}" bindinput="onNextYear" />
    </view>
  </view>

  <button class="btn btn--primary btn-top" bindtap="onArchive">切换学年</button>

  <view class="tip">学年切换只改二课统计口径，不会删除历史数据；毕业成员请先在成员管理中归档。</view>
</view>
